# 播客走代理(2026-08-11,2026-08-12 扩充)
# 核心:itunes-apple.com 覆盖播客 API/音频流/RSS(amp-api.podcasts-lb / audio-ssl / rss / podcasts-cdn)
# 实测部分域名带 .akadns.net(Akamai DNS 后缀)如 amp-api.podcasts-lb.itunes-apple.com.akadns.net
#   → SUFFIX 匹配不到,必须用 KEYWORD 子串匹配(itunes-apple 是 Apple 专用子串,不会误伤)
# applepodcasts.com = Apple Podcasts 节目目录/订阅域名(v2fly apple-podcasts 集合)
# 直连搜不到部分国外节目,必须全走代理
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,itunes-apple
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,itunes-apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,applepodcasts.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,podcasts.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,megaphone.fm
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,omny.fm
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,libsyn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,art19.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,podtrac.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,simplecast.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,buzzsprout.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,transistor.fm
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,anchor.fm
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,spreaker.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,acast.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,audioboom.com
